WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.080
Stop it!

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:03.660
Yuzu...

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.780
I believe in you.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.220
I believe the real Yuya and 
Ute are still within you!

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.420
So take them back!

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.220
Smile like the real you!

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:20.460
Watching Yuzu pray for Yuya, I knew 
for sure that Leo was telling the truth,

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.100
and I decided to interrupt the duel to prevent 
Yuya from awakening as Z-ARC.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.960
I used a bug card I'd gotten from Leo Akaba

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.290
to force the duel to end.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.450
Thanks to the Real Solid Vision 
malfunction it caused,

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.260
Yuya remained bound, even with the duel stopped.

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:41.050
But there was no way to tell how long it would last.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:45.620
Right now, there is one thing I must do!

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.720
I will stop Z-ARC's rebirth.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.110
I won't let Yuya become a devil.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.770
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:59.860
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.340
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.630
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:45.010
The Greedy Venomous Dragon

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.430
Sir! Sir!

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:52.450
Kaito! Edo!

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:53.980
Your leg...

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.650
Have you seen Yuya?

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:57.800
He's acting strangely.

00:02:57.800 --> 00:02:59.480
I think that Doctor was manipulating—

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.360
No!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.980
That isn't it.

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:04.060
Things are far more serious than that.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.200
Yuya...

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.570
I have a report.

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.670
ARC-V energy values have reached 50%.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:16.780
Understood.

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.680
Wait!

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.950
Stop the machine right now!

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:27.390
Stop it!

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.060
Events are already in motion...

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.530
We can no longer go back.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.480
The devil duelist Z-ARC?

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.070
Yuya and Ute are part of it?

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:52.940
Yuya, Ute, Hugo, and Joeri are parts of Z-ARC,

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:58.070
who once brought the world 
to the brink of destruction.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:03.540
And now they're trying to 
reunite and revive Z-ARC!

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.330
That's why Ute is inside Yuya.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:11.300
We can't let them get any closer!

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.020
Hugo...

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.400
But he's Joeri?

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:21.320
Joeri and Hugo are currently 
in the middle of a duel.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.300
What?

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:23.950
Sir!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.780
S-Sorry.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.610
Let me handle this.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:28.670
Edo...

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:32.280
I met Yuya in the Xyz Dimension.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:36.100
He allowed me to understand your teachings 
about bringing smiles with duels.

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:39.700
Now, I will put that into practice!

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:42.280
That's the card I gave him...

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:50.700
He's had it all this time?

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:00.910
Now, become one with me.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:06.420
Starving Venom Fusion Dragon attacks 
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:14.330
Yeah, right... You're gonna 
become one with me.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:17.800
I activate my Continuous Trap Burning Sonic!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:25.000
I negate battle once and increase the 
attack points of the card's target,

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.950
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon, by 500!

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:30.310
Edo!

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:32.110
Stop this duel right now!

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:35.680
Yeah, that was the plan!

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:36.630
Same here!

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:40.220
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:42.420
You two... Don't interrupt!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:46.620
I set one card and end my turn.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:50.850
I'll go first.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:53.360
When there's no monster on my side of the field

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:57.720
and a monster Special Summoned from 
the Extra Deck on my opponent's,

00:05:57.720 --> 00:06:00.210
I can Special Summon this card from my hand.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.430
Cipher Twin Raptor!

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:05.420
And when I Special Summon a Cipher monster,

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.210
I can Special Summon Cipher Biplane.

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:14.420
In addition, Cipher Biplane's effect sets 
Cipher Twin Raptor's level to 8!

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:16.640
Hold on a minute!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.990
I activate Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's effect.

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:23.770
When a monster, of Level 5 or more, 
activates its effect,

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:27.100
I negate that effect and destroy the card!

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:29.000
Dichroic Mirror!

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:35.240
Then, Clear Wing's attack points

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:39.610
increase by those of the monster it 
destroyed until the end of the turn!

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:42.890
On the turn when Cipher Biplane is destroyed,

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:45.510
by banishing the Biplane sent to the graveyard,

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:48.980
I can add one Cipher Wing 
from my deck to my hand.

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:50.410
Then, I Normal Summon it!

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.040
I tribute Cipher Wing to activate its effect.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:00.830
I increase the level of all Cipher 
monsters on the field by 4!

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.240
He planned it all, eh?

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:08.520
Then, using its own effect,

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:13.080
Cipher Twin Raptor counts as two 
Xyz components, which I overlay!

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:20.150
Galaxy shining in the darkness...

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:24.090
Dwell within the god of vengeance 
and become my servant!

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:25.790
Xyz Summon!

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:31.300
Descend, Rank 8 Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon!

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:34.350
Battle...

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:39.040
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon attacks 
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:46.280
Attacking 4000-attack-point Clear Wing 
with 3000-attack-point Galaxy Eyes?

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:49.280
Quick-Play Spell Attack Reversal!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:54.360
I swap the attack points of Galaxy-Eyes Cipher 
Dragon with Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:57.150
Then I'll do the same!

00:07:57.150 --> 00:08:00.360
I activate the effect of Continuous 
Trap Burning Sonic!

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:03.560
By sending Burning Sonic to the graveyard,

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:06.530
I negate Attack Reversal's effect!

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:10.860
And the attack points increased 
by Burning Sonic's effect lower.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.720
He dodged it?

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:16.070
Clear Wing's attack points are still higher...

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:20.120
Quick-Play Spell Rank-Up-Magic Cipher Shock!

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:25.620
When a Cipher Xyz Monster on my 
side of the field is destroyed,

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:30.810
I negate its destruction and 
all monster effects this turn.

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:34.610
But you still take the damage!

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:40.200
I use Cipher Shock's effect 
to end the Battle Phase.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.360
I use Rank 8 Galaxy-Eyes Cipher 
Dragon as a component

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:47.810
to Xyz Summon a Cipher monster 
of one higher rank!

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.090
Galaxy shining in the darkness...

00:08:56.480 --> 00:09:00.990
Release your eternal light to guide us to the future.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:03.720
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:08.660
Descend, Rank 9 Neo 
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon!

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:13.530
I use all Neo Galaxy-Eyes Cipher 
Dragon's Overlay Units

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:20.100
to take control of as many of your monsters 
as I can, with effects negated!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.840
Cipher Super Projection!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:27.640
These monsters become Neo 
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragons.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:30.650
A-Amazing...

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.650
He even stole the enemy monsters.

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:34.410
The rest is up to you.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.990
Do everything you can.

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:41.790
I set one card, and end my—

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.290
Hold it!

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:48.400
In that instant, I Special Summon 
Speedroid Skull Marbles!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:53.680
During the End Phase of a turn when you 
Special Summoned from your Extra Deck,

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:58.140
if there are no monsters on my field, 
I can Special Summon this card.

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:03.550
Its attack points are 0. An easy win, right?

00:10:03.550 --> 00:10:06.430
Next turn, go ahead and attack it.

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:11.160
Though, it'll use its monster effect to reflect
 battle damage and take you out.

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.360
You still had one move remaining?

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:16.910
Sorry. I'd hoped to leave you ideal battle conditions.

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.890
No, this is more than enough.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.030
My turn!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.390
Edo Phoenix...

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:31.450
He graduated valedictorian of Academia

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:35.980
and was promoted to commander of the 
Xyz Dimension Expeditionary Force.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.020
I didn't like him.

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:41.140
Sora Shiunin?

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:45.420
After you graduate, I hope you 
will serve under my command.

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:46.980
I have high hopes for you.

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.650
No, thanks.

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:53.230
I don't need an army. I can do everything myself.

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:58.740
That was why I asked to invade 
the Standard Dimension alone.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:01.030
But I know what you can do.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:03.530
I'm counting on you, Edo.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:07.610
I activate my spell card Polymerization!

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:11.660
And I send Destiny HERO — Decider

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:15.350
and Destiny HERO — Dreamer from my 
hand to the graveyard to fuse them!

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:18.160
The hero who decides the fate of victory...

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:20.560
The hero of the world of dreams...

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:24.000
Become one now, and reign 
over a future of darkness!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.600
Fusion Summon!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.880
Come on, Destiny HERO — Dystopia!

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.400
Dystopia's effect...

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:41.100
I deal the attack points of Decider, used as 
a fusion component, as damage to Hugo!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.380
Squeeze Palm!

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:47.220
I activate my Continuous Trap 
Speedroid Shuriken Hurricane!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:52.390
I negate effect damage, and I turn 
that damage back on you, Edo!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:57.030
Then I return Decider to my hand 
from the graveyard,

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:59.760
and negate effect damage to myself!

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:02.640
Damn you... Just die already!

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.270
Calm down, Hugo!

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:06.500
Shut up!

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:09.320
I need to end this duel at once.

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:14.180
I activate my spell card D-Dragging 
Hammer from my hand!

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:19.620
I equip Decider in my hand to Dystopia!

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:24.090
Dystopia's attack points decrease 
by those of Decider!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.280
Lowering your own attack points?

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:28.270
What's he planning?

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:32.060
I activate Continuous Trap Shuriken 
Hurricane's second effect.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:35.870
Once per turn, when a monster's 
attack points change,

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:38.770
I can deal you damage equal to their amount!

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:42.340
I activate Dystopia's effect!

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:46.760
Once, on either of our turns, when its 
attack or defense points change,

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:48.980
I can destroy one card on the field!

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:50.860
Noble Justice!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:13:00.610
When there are no Speedroid 
monsters on my side of the field,

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:02.190
Shuriken Hurricane is destroyed.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:04.730
Remember, Hugo!

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:07.330
You came here to find Rin, didn't you?

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:08.700
Rin...

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:17.660
Hey, can we end the nonsense already?

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:21.910
Don't forget that I am the 
one you're here to fight.

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:24.090
Remember, Hugo!

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:26.780
I know you haven't really forgotten about Rin!

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:32.420
Dystopia attacks Hugo directly!

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:34.390
Dystopia Blow!

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:37.600
I activate Speedroid Tri-Eyed Dice's effect!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.830
I banish it from my graveyard 
to negate your attack.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:46.700
He's completely sealed off.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.200
No, I still have a chance.

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:52.730
He responded when I said Rin's name, 
if only for a second.

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.180
The real Hugo is not yet gone.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:14:00.080
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:03.550
What an obnoxious little fly...

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:05.290
My turn!

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:10.120
I summon my Tuner Monster 
Speedroid Maliciousmagnet!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.900
I activate Maliciousmagnet's effect!

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.600
I can choose one monster on my 
opponent's field that isn't a Tuner,

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:19.570
and Synchro Summon with it.

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:22.960
I'm taking my Clear Wing back.

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:29.260
Level 1 Maliciousmagnet tunes Level 7 
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:35.530
Let the clear wings, infused with holy power,

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:38.160
shine and strike at the enemy!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:39.620
Synchro Summon!

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:45.330
Appear, Level 8 Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:48.000
Battle.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:53.570
Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon attacks 
Destiny HERO — Dystopia!

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:58.200
I activate my Continuous Trap Urban Demise!

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:02.730
Dystopia's attack points increase by 100.

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.580
Dystopia's effect!

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:08.190
When its attack or defense points change,

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:10.450
I can destroy one card on your field!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.320
Listen to what I am saying...

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.990
Noble Justice!

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:15.130
It's no use.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:21.070
Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon negates 
Dystopia's effect, destroying it!

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:22.070
I won't let you!

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:25.270
I activate Continuous Trap Split Guard!

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:28.700
When there are two or more monsters 
on my field with the same name,

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:32.470
I can negate one monster's destruction 
by battle or effects!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:42.010
It seems both you and Yuya 
were once the same person.

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:44.250
Then, you must know...

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.460
Duels aren't a tool of war!

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.060
They exist to bring smiles to everyone.

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:51.800
That is what Yuya taught me!

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:52.640
Edo...

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:56.270
You should have that same spirit!

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:59.740
Quit your jabbering! The battle isn't over yet!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.600
When Crystal Wing does battle with 
a monster of Level 5 or above,

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:07.850
its attack points increase by those of that monster!

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:11.050
I'm not done talking yet!

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:14.750
The effect of Dreamer in my graveyard!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:18.460
When a D-HERO on my field 
is destroyed by battle,

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:21.400
I negate its destruction and battle damage.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:25.900
And I can also Special Summon Dreamer 
from the graveyard in attack position!

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:31.540
Then, your attacking monster can 
declare battle once more this turn!

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:33.760
Negating battle again?

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:38.960
Crystal Wing's monster effect ends, 
and its attack points return to normal.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:41.100
I will take it down as often as necessary.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.520
Until you recover your real self!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.860
Shut up...

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:47.950
I'll end this with Crystal Wing's second battle.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:48.520
Battle!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.570
I will not give up.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:53.690
Yuya taught me the true beauty of dueling.

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.460
Now it's my turn!

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:59.280
While Yuya himself is on the verge 
of being swallowed by darkness.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.430
Please... Save him from that abyss.

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:05.600
I activate my trap card D-Fusion!

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:10.070
I send Dystopia and Dreamer 
on my field to the graveyard

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:11.910
to Fusion Summon!

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.520
The hero of the world of darkness...

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:16.670
The hero of the world of dreams...

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:20.640
Become one now, and reign 
over a twilight utopia!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:21.920
Fusion Summon!

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:32.630
Come on, Destiny HERO — Dusktopia!

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:40.140
From dystopia to utopia...

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:42.190
I won't let you become part of Z-ARC!

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.700
I will save you both from the darkness!

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:48.710
Just as hope's light can turn a 
wasteland into the promised land.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.740
Damn you...

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:56.420
Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon attacks Dusktopia!

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:02.170
Its effect increases its attack points 
by those of your monster.

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:06.600
Gale Crystalous Edge!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.900
Dusktopia's effect!

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:12.840
This turn, it isn't destroyed by battle, 
and damage dealt is reduced to 0!

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:21.980
Hugo!

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:30.620
Hugo... Huuugo!

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:34.590
It isn't "Huuugo." It's "Hugo"!

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:39.610
You did it, Edo.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.460
He really did save Hugo.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:48.970
That was close. I nearly forgot myself...

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:50.770
I now end my turn.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.940
I'll say it again!

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:56.500
I'll crush you for stealing Rin!

00:18:57.140 --> 00:18:58.680
My turn.

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:05.100
I summon Predaplant 
Sarraceniant from my hand!

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:10.240
Joeri, after Hugo...

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:12.200
I'm going to make you smile.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:16.000
Hey, now... I think you're 
getting a bit full of yourself.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:19.170
You should know your place, dregs!

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:24.080
I send Predaplant Drosophyllum Hydra 
from my hand to the graveyard,

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:27.500
to activate Quick-Play Spell Super Polymerization!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.270
Super...

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:28.810
Polymer...

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:29.750
...ization?

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:34.800
Super Polymerization lets me 
use not only my monsters,

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:38.390
but monsters on your field, 
as fusion components.

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:39.930
What?

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:46.300
I fuse Sarraceniant and...

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:48.100
Kaito, was it?

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:52.580
The Starving Venom Fusion 
Dragon you stole from me.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:03.780
Poisonous dragon with hungry fangs...

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:07.000
Fragrant flower that drags others to hell...

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:11.490
Become one and eat to your heart's content!

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:13.120
Fusion Summon!

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:19.100
Appear, Level 10 Greedy Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:23.100
I activate Greedy Venom Fusion Dragon's effect.

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.670
Until the End Phase of my turn,

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:29.340
I negate one opponent monster's effect 
and reduce its attack points to 0!

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:33.040
I choose Dusktopia.

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:38.550
I activate Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon's effect!

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:42.400
Just once, on either of our turns, I can

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:45.720
negate one monster's effect 
and destroy that monster!

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:51.080
And until the end of this turn,

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:55.820
Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon's effect raises 
its attack points by those of that monster!

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:57.440
Now you're finished!

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:59.530
Are you sure about that?

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:03.820
When Greedy Venom Fusion Dragon is destroyed,

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:06.380
I destroy all monsters on the field

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:11.880
and deal damage equal to their original 
attack points to their controllers!

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.590
No! That'll kill them!

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:17.190
No, if it's just one monster...

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:19.560
Dusktopia's effect!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:21.360
Once, during either of our turns,

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:25.360
I can negate one monster's 
destruction by an effect!

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:27.560
One monster?

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:29.770
The monster I choose is...

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:33.940
Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:36.310
Anastasis Gleam!

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:39.810
Edo!

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:42.150
Make sure you win, Hugo!

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.140
Then, I'll...

00:21:58.760 --> 00:22:00.470
I'll handle the rest.

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:02.510
Their feelings—

00:22:02.510 --> 00:22:05.530
I won't let their feelings be in vain.

00:22:05.940 --> 00:22:07.530
I'll say it once again...

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:09.510
I'm gonna crush you!

00:23:49.350 --> 00:23:53.210
"I'm the only one who can stop Z-ARC's rebirth."

00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:54.680
That's what Ray is saying!

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:56.980
Ray is? What do you mean?

00:23:56.980 --> 00:23:59.380
We don't have time to talk like this.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:01.790
If the dimensions are united,

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:05.000
our original dimensions may be destroyed!

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:08.260
Brother, don't you want to see Ray?

00:24:08.260 --> 00:24:10.160
She's your real sister!

00:24:10.570 --> 00:24:14.430
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Light in Everlasting Darkness.

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:16.950
The fun is only getting started!
